1
00:02:49,800 --> 00:02:51,440
You have to become...

2
00:02:52,200 --> 00:02:53,200
...my substitute.

3
00:02:54,560 --> 00:02:56,160
Everyone will die.

4
00:02:58,200 --> 00:03:00,080
- Thank you for bringing me back.
- It was my pleasure.

5
00:03:02,560 --> 00:03:04,560
I am the one you love.

6
00:03:05,200 --> 00:03:07,799
We're leaving together.

7
00:03:07,800 --> 00:03:11,680
Sairung is your older sister.

8
00:03:12,440 --> 00:03:14,880
Sairung is my older sister.

9
00:03:16,200 --> 00:03:19,600
This island feels familiar.

10
00:03:20,560 --> 00:03:22,920
But I can't remember when I've been here.

11
00:03:24,200 --> 00:03:27,760
And it feels like
there's something stuck in my head.

12
00:03:28,760 --> 00:03:30,080
But I can't remember it.

13
00:03:31,040 --> 00:03:34,280
Whenever I try too hard to remember,
my head starts to hurt.

14
00:03:44,760 --> 00:03:47,760
Do you remember someone named Narathon?

15
00:03:49,560 --> 00:03:50,800
Narathon?

16
00:03:55,120 --> 00:03:56,479
Who is he?

17
00:03:56,480 --> 00:03:58,880
He's the person you love.

18
00:04:01,040 --> 00:04:03,320
Isn't Mr. Men the one I love?

19
00:04:04,920 --> 00:04:08,040
That evil ghost must've put you
under a spell, Kaimook.

20
00:04:10,200 --> 00:04:12,200
What are you talking about?
I don't understand.

21
00:04:14,000 --> 00:04:15,880
I'll tell you the truth.

22
00:04:16,800 --> 00:04:21,600
But you have to promise
to help me in return.

23
00:04:22,720 --> 00:04:23,840
Deal?

24
00:04:33,480 --> 00:04:34,720
What truth?

25
00:04:37,640 --> 00:04:40,719
Men isn't human. He's a ghost.

26
00:04:40,720 --> 00:04:44,920
He brought you here
because he's fallen for you.

27
00:04:50,760 --> 00:04:56,720
The one you love is Narathon, not Men.

28
00:05:07,800 --> 00:05:09,280
Mr. Narathon.

29
00:05:14,880 --> 00:05:16,880
I told you the truth.

30
00:05:19,200 --> 00:05:21,600
Now it's your turn to help me.

31
00:05:24,120 --> 00:05:25,240
Help what?

32
00:05:26,400 --> 00:05:27,800
Let me kill you.

33
00:05:28,320 --> 00:05:30,880
So you can become my substitute.

34
00:05:32,960 --> 00:05:34,120
Sairung?

35
00:05:59,120 --> 00:06:02,240
No, don't hurt me.

36
00:06:23,400 --> 00:06:25,000
Give me back my ring.

37
00:06:28,240 --> 00:06:30,560
You'll never see him again.

38
00:06:36,880 --> 00:06:39,800
No. No.

39
00:06:43,880 --> 00:06:44,960
No!

40
00:06:53,320 --> 00:06:54,280
Kaimook.

41
00:07:06,360 --> 00:07:07,680
Kaimook.

42
00:07:09,000 --> 00:07:12,040
You are my lover.

43
00:07:17,800 --> 00:07:19,960
I am your lover.

44
00:07:32,400 --> 00:07:33,880
Sairung.

45
00:07:39,440 --> 00:07:41,480
Any servant who dares betray me...

46
00:07:43,360 --> 00:07:46,680
will be punished accordingly.

47
00:07:49,360 --> 00:07:50,320
I surrender!

48
00:07:54,920 --> 00:07:57,479
I surrender! I won't do it again!

49
00:07:57,480 --> 00:07:59,040
Sairung.

50
00:08:12,200 --> 00:08:14,999
Please, dear.

51
00:08:15,000 --> 00:08:16,799
Let me go with you.

52
00:08:16,800 --> 00:08:19,120
You should stay here.

53
00:08:20,520 --> 00:08:21,760
Is Narathon here yet?

54
00:08:22,360 --> 00:08:23,480
Not yet.

55
00:08:29,360 --> 00:08:30,520
I think he's here.

56
00:08:34,760 --> 00:08:37,200
- Hello, Mr. Phum.
- Hello, everyone.

57
00:08:37,720 --> 00:08:38,959
Don't worry.

58
00:08:38,960 --> 00:08:41,280
We'll find a way to save Kaimook.

59
00:08:41,960 --> 00:08:43,039
Thank you.

60
00:08:45,040 --> 00:08:45,880
Hello, Mr. Thongdee.

61
00:08:53,200 --> 00:08:54,160
Uncle Thongdee.

62
00:08:56,960 --> 00:08:58,760
I've missed you so much, sir.

63
00:09:03,840 --> 00:09:06,280
Where's Mr. Narathon?

64
00:09:07,040 --> 00:09:08,400
Isn't he with you?

65
00:09:09,360 --> 00:09:10,240
He was.

66
00:09:10,840 --> 00:09:14,080
But he said he needed to
pick something up at the fish farm.

67
00:09:19,080 --> 00:09:21,440
<i>The number you have dialed
is currently unavailable.</i>

68
00:09:25,080 --> 00:09:27,759
<i>The number you have dialed
is currently unavailable.</i>

69
00:09:27,760 --> 00:09:30,200
Are you sure he went to the fish farm?

70
00:09:30,720 --> 00:09:32,760
I have a feeling
that he went to Skull Island instead.

71
00:10:00,640 --> 00:10:03,880
Kaimook, where are you?

72
00:10:41,480 --> 00:10:42,440
Kaimook.

73
00:10:44,880 --> 00:10:45,840
Kaimook.

74
00:10:50,000 --> 00:10:51,040
Kaimook.

75
00:10:54,240 --> 00:10:55,160
Kaimook.

76
00:11:07,240 --> 00:11:08,560
Kaimook.

77
00:11:10,040 --> 00:11:11,400
Are you alright?

78
00:11:12,960 --> 00:11:16,320
I'm so glad I've found you.

79
00:11:21,560 --> 00:11:22,880
Who are you?

80
00:11:23,480 --> 00:11:25,040
How dare you hug me?

81
00:11:27,360 --> 00:11:28,280
Kaimook.

82
00:11:30,240 --> 00:11:31,800
Kaimook, where are you going?

83
00:11:34,680 --> 00:11:40,280
You're wondering why I let Narathon
find Kaimook so easily, aren't you?

84
00:11:45,320 --> 00:11:49,640
Because I want him to taste despair.

85
00:11:50,280 --> 00:11:53,040
To feel the agony...

86
00:11:53,640 --> 00:11:56,399
of seeing the woman he loves
no longer love him.

87
00:11:56,400 --> 00:11:59,800
He'll never have Kaimook's love again.

88
00:12:01,160 --> 00:12:04,320
Anyone who's in my way must die.

89
00:12:22,440 --> 00:12:24,119
Kaimook.

90
00:12:24,120 --> 00:12:25,239
Wait.

91
00:12:25,240 --> 00:12:27,440
Let me go!

92
00:12:28,160 --> 00:12:30,560
You don't remember me?

93
00:12:31,080 --> 00:12:33,960
I'm Narathon. Don't you remember me?

94
00:12:35,200 --> 00:12:37,559
No. I don't know you.

95
00:12:37,560 --> 00:12:38,919
Let me go!

96
00:12:38,920 --> 00:12:41,040
- Let go.
- Kaimook. Kaimook.

97
00:12:42,560 --> 00:12:45,479
Mr. Men, help me.

98
00:12:45,480 --> 00:12:46,400
Kaimook.

99
00:12:48,280 --> 00:12:51,360
Why did you call him Mr. Men?

100
00:12:55,040 --> 00:12:56,080
I get it now.

101
00:12:57,200 --> 00:13:00,520
He used his magic to erase your memories.

102
00:13:03,760 --> 00:13:05,599
Let me go!

103
00:13:05,600 --> 00:13:07,360
I won't.

104
00:13:09,880 --> 00:13:10,960
Kaimook.

105
00:13:11,560 --> 00:13:15,160
I'll never let you go. Do you understand?

106
00:13:16,080 --> 00:13:17,319
Get yourself together.

107
00:13:17,320 --> 00:13:18,799
Listen to me.

108
00:13:18,800 --> 00:13:21,000
- No.
- You have to listen.

109
00:13:22,680 --> 00:13:24,120
My name is Narathon.

110
00:13:26,320 --> 00:13:27,600
I love you.

111
00:13:29,520 --> 00:13:30,720
I love you so much.

112
00:13:33,120 --> 00:13:35,080
We love each other.

113
00:13:38,040 --> 00:13:41,159
We promised we'd wait for one another.

114
00:13:41,160 --> 00:13:43,040
Don't you remember?

115
00:13:46,880 --> 00:13:47,840
No.

116
00:13:48,800 --> 00:13:49,800
I don't remember.

117
00:15:04,400 --> 00:15:05,840
Mr. Narathon...

118
00:15:12,440 --> 00:15:13,480
Kaimook.

119
00:15:15,400 --> 00:15:16,800
Impossible!

120
00:15:18,560 --> 00:15:20,160
That is the power of true love

121
00:15:21,040 --> 00:15:24,880
that even magic cannot overcome.

122
00:15:41,040 --> 00:15:43,000
Why are we here?

123
00:15:43,520 --> 00:15:44,880
What happened?

124
00:15:48,240 --> 00:15:50,200
Isn't this Skull Island?

125
00:15:50,800 --> 00:15:51,720
Yes.

126
00:15:52,480 --> 00:15:54,160
That ghost brought you here.

127
00:16:05,160 --> 00:16:08,160
We have to get off this island now.

128
00:16:11,000 --> 00:16:11,839
Kaimook.

129
00:16:11,840 --> 00:16:13,800
Whatever happens,

130
00:16:14,520 --> 00:16:16,600
don't let go of my hand.

131
00:16:35,720 --> 00:16:37,400
Mr. Narathon!

132
00:16:42,880 --> 00:16:44,120
Let go of me.

133
00:16:46,080 --> 00:16:48,720
I'll never let you go again, Kaimook.

134
00:16:49,320 --> 00:16:50,480
Come with me.

135
00:16:51,320 --> 00:16:52,199
Let go.

136
00:16:52,200 --> 00:16:54,240
Let go of me. Mr. Narathon!

137
00:16:56,560 --> 00:16:57,520
Kaimook!

138
00:16:58,880 --> 00:16:59,920
Kaimook!

139
00:17:00,960 --> 00:17:02,160
Let go of me!

140
00:17:12,240 --> 00:17:13,880
Mr. Narathon!

141
00:17:25,760 --> 00:17:28,840
Run, Mr. Narathon. Don't worry about me.

142
00:17:32,920 --> 00:17:35,400
Now do you see?
You can't do anything to me.

143
00:17:37,320 --> 00:17:40,840
You should leave
while you still have the chance.

144
00:17:44,360 --> 00:17:46,120
Even if it costs me my life,

145
00:17:47,160 --> 00:17:51,000
I'll never leave this island
without Kaimook.

146
00:18:02,040 --> 00:18:03,440
Good.

147
00:18:04,200 --> 00:18:05,759
Then,

148
00:18:05,760 --> 00:18:09,840
you'll remain here
as a ghost guarding Skull Island.

149
00:18:34,880 --> 00:18:37,879
Please coordinate with the local police
and rescue team as well.

150
00:18:37,880 --> 00:18:40,920
I'll explain the details to you later.
Thanks.

151
00:18:41,920 --> 00:18:45,440
The boat will be at the pier
in 30 minutes. Let's meet there.

152
00:18:47,320 --> 00:18:48,480
Wait.

153
00:18:49,360 --> 00:18:51,680
I don't think all of us should go.

154
00:18:52,800 --> 00:18:56,519
I agree with Mr. Thongdee. Mr. Mek,
your health isn't very good.

155
00:18:56,520 --> 00:18:58,360
You wait here with Kang and Ms. Mhai.

156
00:18:58,960 --> 00:19:02,199
No way. Last time,
I couldn't go help my daughter.

157
00:19:02,200 --> 00:19:03,680
This time, I'm going.

158
00:19:04,880 --> 00:19:08,159
Dad, then who's going to stay with Mom?

159
00:19:08,160 --> 00:19:11,040
- Actually, I want to go too.
- Dear.

160
00:19:11,640 --> 00:19:12,840
We already talked about this.

161
00:19:15,560 --> 00:19:18,079
Alright. I'll wait here.

162
00:19:18,080 --> 00:19:19,640
Yeah, Mom.

163
00:19:20,160 --> 00:19:22,720
If you go, you won't be able
to run from ghosts fast enough.

164
00:19:25,120 --> 00:19:28,680
Please be careful, dear.
Be careful, everyone.

165
00:19:32,600 --> 00:19:33,960
Don't worry.

166
00:19:34,600 --> 00:19:36,840
I'll bring our daughter back safely.

167
00:19:39,960 --> 00:19:40,919
Okay.

168
00:19:40,920 --> 00:19:42,240
Kang.

169
00:19:48,360 --> 00:19:49,760
Stay with Aunt Mhai, okay?

170
00:19:50,560 --> 00:19:51,880
Yes, Mom.

171
00:19:52,560 --> 00:19:54,159
I love you, my son.

172
00:19:54,160 --> 00:19:55,760
I love you too, Mom.

173
00:19:59,400 --> 00:20:01,079
Don't worry.

174
00:20:01,080 --> 00:20:03,120
I'll take care of Kang.

175
00:20:03,720 --> 00:20:04,800
Thank you.

176
00:20:09,400 --> 00:20:11,680
- Please take care of him for me.
- Yes.

177
00:20:12,680 --> 00:20:14,279
Let's meet at the pier.

178
00:20:14,280 --> 00:20:15,320
Okay.

179
00:20:15,840 --> 00:20:16,720
Let's go.

180
00:20:21,000 --> 00:20:23,680
Sarai, what happened?

181
00:20:25,920 --> 00:20:29,960
I feel strange,
as if I might never see Kang again.

182
00:20:34,680 --> 00:20:36,039
Don't worry.

183
00:20:36,040 --> 00:20:38,600
We'll come back to our son together.

184
00:20:48,640 --> 00:20:49,640
Enough.

185
00:20:52,200 --> 00:20:53,640
Please.

186
00:20:54,320 --> 00:20:56,520
I'll marry you.

187
00:21:01,720 --> 00:21:03,039
Do you mean that?

188
00:21:03,040 --> 00:21:04,080
Yes.

189
00:21:05,120 --> 00:21:07,359
But you have to let Mr. Narathon go.

190
00:21:07,360 --> 00:21:09,640
You must not hurt him again.

191
00:21:22,520 --> 00:21:24,240
Mr. Narathon.

192
00:21:27,920 --> 00:21:29,439
Mr. Narathon.

193
00:21:29,440 --> 00:21:31,280
Are you alright?

194
00:21:35,120 --> 00:21:36,319
I'm alright.

195
00:21:36,320 --> 00:21:37,440
Kaimook.

196
00:21:38,920 --> 00:21:40,560
Don't marry him.

197
00:21:45,680 --> 00:21:48,400
I can't watch you die because of me.

198
00:21:53,880 --> 00:21:56,680
I'm willing to die for you.

199
00:22:00,240 --> 00:22:02,120
And what good would that do?

200
00:22:04,080 --> 00:22:05,280
Go back.

201
00:22:06,720 --> 00:22:09,840
Tell my parents and Na not to worry.

202
00:22:10,840 --> 00:22:13,000
Don't let anyone come here.

203
00:22:13,600 --> 00:22:15,240
Otherwise, all of us will die.

204
00:22:17,240 --> 00:22:19,880
I'll handle this myself.

205
00:22:28,640 --> 00:22:31,080
Please, Kaimook. Don't.

206
00:22:32,800 --> 00:22:33,760
I beg.

207
00:22:38,040 --> 00:22:40,680
Goodbye, Mr. Narathon.

208
00:23:01,040 --> 00:23:02,000
Kaimook.

209
00:23:03,920 --> 00:23:04,840
Kaimook.

210
00:23:08,480 --> 00:23:09,560
Kaimook!

211
00:23:11,360 --> 00:23:13,160
Kaimook!

212
00:23:19,880 --> 00:23:20,880
Kaimook!

213
00:23:32,520 --> 00:23:33,440
Skull Island.

214
00:24:01,400 --> 00:24:03,200
Is something wrong, Sarai?

215
00:24:06,120 --> 00:24:09,639
Mr. Phum,
I think staying in Pakarang's body

216
00:24:09,640 --> 00:24:12,160
might make it harder for me
to help everyone.

217
00:24:12,760 --> 00:24:16,920
But you know what will happen
if you leave Pakarang's body for too long.

218
00:24:17,600 --> 00:24:18,999
I know.

219
00:24:19,000 --> 00:24:23,240
But going to Skull island
might be dangerous for Pakarang's body.

220
00:24:24,280 --> 00:24:25,880
I'm scared.

221
00:24:26,440 --> 00:24:28,920
If something happens to Pakarang's body,

222
00:24:29,800 --> 00:24:32,440
I'm afraid I won't be able
to touch you and Kang again.

223
00:24:38,800 --> 00:24:40,719
I understand.

224
00:24:40,720 --> 00:24:43,959
But if your spirit leaves her body,
how will I know where you are?

225
00:24:43,960 --> 00:24:45,520
How will I know if you're safe?

226
00:24:53,920 --> 00:24:55,360
I can help you.

227
00:24:56,640 --> 00:24:57,600
Mr. Thongdee.

228
00:24:59,480 --> 00:25:01,320
I can make everyone see Sarai.

229
00:25:02,400 --> 00:25:04,400
That way, we'll be able
to communicate more easily.

230
00:25:39,000 --> 00:25:40,400
Ms. Sarai.

231
00:25:52,720 --> 00:25:53,560
Da.

232
00:25:55,240 --> 00:25:59,960
Is that the spirit of Sarai
that Mook told us about?

233
00:26:01,640 --> 00:26:02,800
Yes.

234
00:26:20,400 --> 00:26:21,840
Thank you.

235
00:26:28,080 --> 00:26:29,120
Kaimook.

236
00:26:35,440 --> 00:26:36,480
Kaimook!

237
00:26:39,280 --> 00:26:41,760
Kaimook, do you hear me?

238
00:26:53,760 --> 00:26:57,000
I won't go anywhere without you, Kaimook.

239
00:27:00,400 --> 00:27:01,400
Kaimook!

240
00:27:03,360 --> 00:27:04,320
Kaimook!

241
00:27:15,640 --> 00:27:18,200
He really doesn't fear death.

242
00:27:19,760 --> 00:27:21,640
He loves Kaimook with all his heart.

243
00:27:24,800 --> 00:27:27,039
If he doesn't fear death,

244
00:27:27,040 --> 00:27:29,240
then let him die as he wishes.

245
00:27:30,280 --> 00:27:32,440
But you promised Kaimook

246
00:27:32,960 --> 00:27:34,600
you wouldn't hurt Mr. Narathon.

247
00:27:35,840 --> 00:27:39,320
I'm not breaking my promise.
Because I won't be the one who does it.

248
00:27:39,840 --> 00:27:42,080
You will kill him for me.

249
00:28:32,960 --> 00:28:34,680
You may be sad today.

250
00:28:35,960 --> 00:28:38,839
But one day, you'll change your mind.

251
00:28:38,840 --> 00:28:42,400
And in the end, you'll love me
the way I love you.

252
00:28:44,320 --> 00:28:46,640
Someone like you knows what love is?

253
00:28:49,200 --> 00:28:51,120
Why would you say that?

254
00:28:51,640 --> 00:28:54,720
If I didn't love you,
why would I bring you here?

255
00:28:58,760 --> 00:29:00,120
Why does it have to be me?

256
00:29:34,720 --> 00:29:35,560
Mook.

257
00:29:37,160 --> 00:29:38,080
Men.

258
00:29:50,880 --> 00:29:52,240
It's so beautiful!

259
00:29:55,800 --> 00:29:56,880
Do you like it?

260
00:29:57,600 --> 00:29:58,880
I do.

261
00:30:00,600 --> 00:30:03,200
I went all the way
to the market in town to buy it.

262
00:30:05,480 --> 00:30:07,879
It must have been expensive.

263
00:30:07,880 --> 00:30:10,320
You shouldn't have spent your money on me.

264
00:30:13,880 --> 00:30:15,599
It's okay.

265
00:30:15,600 --> 00:30:19,640
I've been lucky lately.
I've been catching a lot of fish.

266
00:30:20,280 --> 00:30:22,760
I'll go fishing every single day.

267
00:30:23,560 --> 00:30:25,600
I'll earn lots of money.

268
00:30:26,640 --> 00:30:29,800
I'll do everything I can
to make you happy.

269
00:30:35,400 --> 00:30:36,840
Just wait for me.

270
00:30:49,440 --> 00:30:50,360
Hurry!

271
00:30:54,560 --> 00:30:55,879
The village has been raided.

272
00:30:55,880 --> 00:30:58,000
- Sai, my daughter.
- Mook!

273
00:31:02,080 --> 00:31:03,959
Mook.

274
00:31:03,960 --> 00:31:05,199
Mook!

275
00:31:05,200 --> 00:31:07,640
Sai.

276
00:31:09,160 --> 00:31:10,639
Where are you?

277
00:31:10,640 --> 00:31:11,880
Mom.

278
00:31:12,400 --> 00:31:13,600
Mom.

279
00:31:14,480 --> 00:31:17,840
Mom.

280
00:31:19,600 --> 00:31:20,679
Mom.

281
00:31:20,680 --> 00:31:22,320
Mom!

282
00:31:24,560 --> 00:31:25,880
Mom!

283
00:31:30,640 --> 00:31:31,720
Mook.

284
00:31:48,600 --> 00:31:50,320
Mook.

285
00:31:58,720 --> 00:32:01,520
Mook! Mook!

286
00:32:05,520 --> 00:32:06,400
Mook.

287
00:32:12,120 --> 00:32:14,360
Mook, what happened?

288
00:32:15,400 --> 00:32:16,800
Men.

289
00:32:19,640 --> 00:32:22,640
Mook, stay with me.
I'll take you to a doctor.

290
00:32:29,280 --> 00:32:30,360
Mook.

291
00:32:33,120 --> 00:32:34,080
Mook!

292
00:32:35,760 --> 00:32:36,760
Mook!

293
00:32:38,000 --> 00:32:39,880
Mook, don't die.

294
00:32:42,200 --> 00:32:43,120
No!

295
00:33:00,480 --> 00:33:02,520
But I'm not the woman you love.

296
00:33:03,040 --> 00:33:06,000
I'm not Mook. I'm Kaimook.

297
00:33:06,840 --> 00:33:09,160
And there's already someone I love.

298
00:33:10,000 --> 00:33:11,680
I'm not that woman.

299
00:33:12,200 --> 00:33:13,720
I don't care.

300
00:33:14,520 --> 00:33:17,199
All I know is
the moment I saw you on this island,

301
00:33:17,200 --> 00:33:18,960
I fell in love with you.

302
00:33:19,800 --> 00:33:22,760
And I promised myself
I'd never lose you again.

303
00:33:24,200 --> 00:33:26,440
I'll make you happy.

304
00:33:27,280 --> 00:33:30,520
I'll give you everything you want.

305
00:34:00,280 --> 00:34:01,360
Don't be afraid.

306
00:34:03,160 --> 00:34:05,279
Look down into the graves.

307
00:34:05,280 --> 00:34:08,880
You'll see something
that no one has ever seen.

308
00:34:18,400 --> 00:34:19,880
Ancient treasure?

309
00:34:21,600 --> 00:34:22,440
That's right.

310
00:34:24,320 --> 00:34:27,159
The ancient treasure and gold

311
00:34:29,040 --> 00:34:33,759
that everyone longs for.
The reason countless people

312
00:34:33,760 --> 00:34:35,760
have come searching on Skull Island.

313
00:34:41,159 --> 00:34:43,679
Where did you get this journal?

314
00:34:44,600 --> 00:34:46,400
From the research station on Skull Island.

315
00:34:48,040 --> 00:34:51,639
So the ghosts we met
on the island were pirates

316
00:34:52,280 --> 00:34:55,440
who stole the government's gold
many years ago?

317
00:34:57,920 --> 00:34:59,320
I'm not sure.

318
00:35:01,400 --> 00:35:03,480
I tried looking into it.

319
00:35:05,040 --> 00:35:08,000
But strangely enough,
it's like all the records were erased.

320
00:35:09,640 --> 00:35:13,480
There should have been news reports
or something. But there's nothing.

321
00:35:16,640 --> 00:35:21,160
If those ghosts really were pirates,

322
00:35:23,000 --> 00:35:26,320
then the government's treasure
must still be on Skull Island.

323
00:35:28,240 --> 00:35:29,600
That's possible.

324
00:35:31,600 --> 00:35:36,680
That's why people want to go there
even though it's a cursed island.

325
00:35:44,440 --> 00:35:47,280
This is the government's treasure
that you stole.

326
00:35:51,480 --> 00:35:56,240
After Mook died, I was furious
that doing good had brought me nothing.

327
00:35:57,040 --> 00:35:58,920
So I became a pirate.

328
00:35:59,920 --> 00:36:01,840
I killed the men who murdered Mook

329
00:36:02,360 --> 00:36:04,239
and took their place as leader.

330
00:36:04,240 --> 00:36:06,160
I raided every merchant ship

331
00:36:06,680 --> 00:36:09,280
including the one carrying
the government's treasure.

332
00:36:11,040 --> 00:36:13,480
Then why did you have
to kill so many people?

333
00:36:19,040 --> 00:36:22,320
So they could guard my treasure here.

334
00:36:25,520 --> 00:36:27,120
You're cruel.

335
00:36:28,400 --> 00:36:31,840
And what about what they did to me?!
Wasn't that cruel?!

336
00:36:34,280 --> 00:36:37,879
I mastered the dark arts
to become invincible.

337
00:36:37,880 --> 00:36:40,119
To become the greatest pirate!

338
00:36:40,120 --> 00:36:42,200
No one could ever defeat me.

339
00:36:50,120 --> 00:36:53,720
Please change your ways, Mr. Men.
You've lost your way.

340
00:36:54,240 --> 00:36:56,120
It's not too late to turn back.

341
00:36:58,880 --> 00:37:01,519
Don't waste your time
trying to persuade me.

342
00:37:01,520 --> 00:37:03,479
I'll stay here

343
00:37:03,480 --> 00:37:05,000
like this.

344
00:37:08,720 --> 00:37:11,440
I'll stay with you on our island.

345
00:37:12,480 --> 00:37:15,920
Anyone who tries to take you away from me

346
00:37:16,520 --> 00:37:18,200
will die.

347
00:37:33,240 --> 00:37:34,560
Go back.

348
00:37:35,640 --> 00:37:39,640
This island is concealed by magic.
You'll never find Ms. Kaimook.

349
00:37:41,840 --> 00:37:43,080
No.

350
00:37:44,360 --> 00:37:47,800
I'll find her no matter what.
I have to save her.

351
00:37:49,040 --> 00:37:51,320
Even if it costs you your life?

352
00:37:56,640 --> 00:37:58,840
If you won't listen,

353
00:37:59,360 --> 00:38:01,120
then I have no choice.

354
00:38:07,120 --> 00:38:09,200
- Dad!
- Sarai.

355
00:38:20,920 --> 00:38:23,280
I told you never
to come back to this island.

356
00:38:24,760 --> 00:38:29,360
I had to come to help Mr. Narathon
and Kaimook. They've done so much for me.

357
00:38:29,960 --> 00:38:31,680
And I came to save you too, Dad.

358
00:38:32,200 --> 00:38:33,720
How are you?

359
00:38:36,040 --> 00:38:37,719
I'm not that easy to kill, Dad.

360
00:38:37,720 --> 00:38:40,000
But you look terrible.

361
00:38:42,080 --> 00:38:44,840
- We have to find Kaimook.
- Calm down, Thon.

362
00:38:45,440 --> 00:38:49,880
Mr. Mek, Dara, and Mana split up to search
for her. Maybe they've already found her.

363
00:38:51,440 --> 00:38:53,280
It won't be that easy.

364
00:38:56,280 --> 00:38:59,360
You know where Kaimook is, don't you?

365
00:39:22,960 --> 00:39:23,960
Did you find your sister?

366
00:39:24,800 --> 00:39:26,280
No, Dad.

367
00:39:46,280 --> 00:39:47,920
Is something wrong, Mr. Thongdee?

368
00:39:50,920 --> 00:39:52,760
He's hidden everything from our sight.

369
00:40:21,640 --> 00:40:22,480
Wait.

370
00:40:23,360 --> 00:40:24,920
I'll lure Men out first.

371
00:40:25,760 --> 00:40:27,280
Find a place to hide.

372
00:40:28,080 --> 00:40:30,200
When you see
two glowing lights flying away,

373
00:40:31,040 --> 00:40:34,920
then go rescue Kaimook and get off
this island as fast as you can.

374
00:40:49,400 --> 00:40:50,600
Mr. Thongdee.

375
00:40:54,640 --> 00:40:55,920
Please be careful.

376
00:40:56,720 --> 00:40:57,760
Don't worry.

377
00:40:58,280 --> 00:41:02,200
I have an iron dagger
that can break any form of magic.

378
00:41:21,560 --> 00:41:23,799
Our special moment is almost here.

379
00:41:23,800 --> 00:41:26,399
I'm sure you'll look beautiful

380
00:41:26,400 --> 00:41:27,800
wearing this dress.

381
00:41:46,720 --> 00:41:51,360
<i>Why force a woman to love you
when she doesn't love you back?</i>

382
00:41:54,480 --> 00:41:55,600
Mr. Thongdee.

383
00:41:59,800 --> 00:42:01,440
You again, Thongdee?

384
00:42:02,120 --> 00:42:06,240
Last time, you ran away.
And yet you dare come back?

385
00:42:07,280 --> 00:42:08,840
But this time,

386
00:42:09,440 --> 00:42:12,280
the one who'll be running away
won't be me.

387
00:42:14,120 --> 00:42:17,360
Good. Then I won't let you escape again.

388
00:42:19,400 --> 00:42:20,480
We'll see.

389
00:42:54,400 --> 00:42:55,480
What's happening?

390
00:42:57,240 --> 00:42:58,840
Men has left the tent.

391
00:43:00,840 --> 00:43:02,720
Then let's hurry and save Kaimook.

392
00:43:05,520 --> 00:43:07,680
Dad and I will go first.

393
00:43:09,000 --> 00:43:10,400
Be careful, Sarai.

394
00:43:20,520 --> 00:43:21,520
Let's go.

395
00:43:43,240 --> 00:43:44,440
Thon, move!

396
00:43:53,080 --> 00:43:55,400
Your time to die has come, Thongdee.

397
00:43:57,000 --> 00:43:59,079
<i>There's only one way you'll survive.</i>

398
00:43:59,080 --> 00:44:00,239
You have to kill him.

399
00:44:00,240 --> 00:44:02,239
You need Thongdee's iron dagger.

400
00:44:02,240 --> 00:44:03,919
Its power can kill him.

401
00:44:03,920 --> 00:44:04,959
Where is the dagger?

402
00:44:04,960 --> 00:44:06,560
On Men's ghost ship.

403
00:44:36,560 --> 00:44:39,560
Subtitle translation by: Panuwat Baikeawon
